  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a copper pot over medium-high heat.",
    "add chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "add onion and garlic and stir-fry until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "add ginger, chili peppers, and bay leaves, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add peach juice, salt, black pepper, cumin, and tandoor powder.",
    "bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped cilantro, if desired."
  ],
